OL,3,AJury directions on rape myths should
OL,4,Aalways be given, new guidance for
OL,5,AEngland and Wales says
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudges have been told directions to
OL,8,Fjuries on rape myths "should always be
OL,9,Fgiven" in updated guidance following
OL,10,FRussel Brand's trial.
OL,12,FThe Crown Court Compendium, which
OL,13,Fprovides judges with guidance on
OL,14,Fdirecting juries in Crown Court trials,
OL,15,Fwas updated on 24 November to add that
OL,16,Falerting a jury to the "potential
OL,17,Ferror" of this kind of thinking "remain
OL,18,Fimportant and necessary."
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
