OL,3,AJury directions on rape myths should
OL,4,Aalways be given, new guidance for
OL,5,AEngland and Wales says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis messaging now appears in the
OL,8,Fofficial handbook published by the
OL,9,FJudicial College, which guides judges
OL,10,Fand recorders in England and Wales.
OL,12,FIt comes after the justice secretary
OL,13,Fcalled for new rules to prevent
OL,14,Fbarristers from using rape myths to
OL,15,Fdefend their clients in the wake of the
OL,16,FBrand trial.
